Topic: AWS Elastic Beanstalk — Simplify Application Deployment

Today’s focus is on AWS Elastic Beanstalk, a fully managed Platform-as-a-Service (PaaS) that lets you deploy, manage, and scale applications automatically without manually handling servers, load balancers, or scaling groups.

Whether you’re deploying Java, Node.js, Python, or Docker-based apps, Beanstalk streamlines the process from code to production.

